damage.  And Third, to go Genoless again.  It turns out I didn't need to do
# 2 as I hit a bonesfile a level or two above medusa of some poor Ro who got
disintegrated by a black dragon while carrying the MKoT.  Thanks to Hearse
and whoever left the bones.



